          "Pista 2: $V_{BE,total} = 0.7\\text{ V} + 0.7\\text{ V} = 1.4\\text{ V}$.",
          "Pista 3: $V_E = 5.4\\text{ V} - 1.4\\text{ V} = 4.0\\text{ V}$."
